* `test_mlist_exists` – `reading-group@local.edu` exists
* `test_join_flow` – mailing `reading-group-join@local.edu` creates a confirmation message, replying confirms subscription, member is present

Join/leave via `reading-group-join@local.edu` / `reading-group-leave@local.edu` and posting via `reading-group@local.edu` now work with open subscription policy and confirmation by reply. The Mailman configuration file is saved at `/etc/mailman3/mailman.cfg`.


